            "markup": "\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003ESantiago High School will provide our diverse student body with an equitable education. Students at Santiago are held to high expectations of academic achievement and citizenship.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EStudents engage in multiple opportunities to succeed through rigorous, standards-based curricula, diverse and inclusive extracurricular programs, and comprehensive academic and socio-emotional support.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(74, 31, 122);\u0022\u003ESuccessful: Goal 3 Life-Long Success\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EScholars will be college- and career-ready by completing graduation requirements.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EScholars will demonstrate grit and resilience as they prepare (plan) for lifelong success in their intended college and career paths.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(74, 31, 122);\u0022\u003ECivic-Minded: Goal 2 Personal Skills\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EScholars will respect individual differences and embrace the community\u0027s cultural diversity.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EScholars will contribute to improving the quality of life within their community.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(74, 31, 122);\u0022\u003ECritical Thinkers: Goal 1 Academic Skills\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 12pt;\u0022\u003EScholars will access a rigorous curriculum by developing critical thinking skills to analyze and evaluate information in order to make and communicate informed decisions.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022text-align: left;\u0022\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
